            "description_html": "<b>1\" Diameter Deco Cabinet Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis beautiful 1\" diameter cone shaped deco style cabinet knob is perfect to implement a minimalism retro look. Solid brass construction means that this cabinet pull will stand the test of time. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/DWD-CAB-DECO1-size.gif?v=1704354687\" width=\"580\" height=\"200\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Deco Cabinet Knob Size\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/deco-shower-door-knob-sd-deco1\"><b>Deco Shower Door Knob</b></a> and  <a href=\"/products/deco-shower-door-knob-pair-sd-deco2\"><b>Deco Shower Door Knob Pair</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAvailable in 7 different finish colors to match your rooms decor. Packaged with #8-32 x 1-1/2\" screw for easy installation.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications:</b> for Deco Cabinet Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Base Diameter: 1\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 1-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>*Sold Individually</b>\r\n</p>",
